# KV-cache dtype rollout

Owner: Infrastructure / Serving Runtime  
Scope: vLLM checkpoint-declared KV-cache quantization

## Validated precedence rule

Treat checkpoint KV-cache quantization metadata as a storage-format contract.

1. If the checkpoint declares a recognized `kv_cache_quant_algo`, an omitted
   `--kv-cache-dtype` and explicit `--kv-cache-dtype auto` both resolve to
   the checkpoint format.
2. A matching explicit dtype is accepted and canonicalized (`fp8` and
   `fp8_e4m3` denote the same ModelOpt FP8 format).
3. A non-matching explicit dtype is rejected during configuration, before cache
   allocation or model execution, with guidance to use `auto` or the declared
   dtype.
4. Without metadata, `auto` retains the existing model-dtype behavior and an
   explicit dtype remains authoritative, subject to normal platform/backend
   validation.

## Compatibility matrix

| Checkpoint metadata | Requested dtype | Resolution | Deployment compatibility |
|---|---|---|---|
| ModelOpt `FP8` | omitted / `auto` | `fp8_e4m3` | CUDA 11.8+ or ROCm FP8 E4M3 path; CPU only on supported x86 AMX/vector path |
| ModelOpt `FP8` | `fp8` / `fp8_e4m3` | `fp8_e4m3` | Same as above |
| ModelOpt `FP8` | `bfloat16`, `float16`, E5M2, or other mismatch | configuration error | Unsupported: do not deploy |
| no KV metadata | omitted / `auto` | model dtype downstream | Existing baseline path |
| no KV metadata | explicit supported dtype | explicit dtype | Must pass platform and attention-backend checks |
| E5M2 explicit, no metadata | `fp8_e5m2` | `fp8_e5m2` | CUDA 11.8+ generally; not ROCm, and selected CUDA FlashAttention paths do not support it |
| HPU FP8 | `fp8_inc` | `fp8_inc` | Intel Gaudi only |","content_hash":"613cacaf591685cf5bb57115e0a2fe330dea249e46daf7207b24abbbab2518db","chunk_metadata":{"ordinal":0,"document_path":"/knowledge/runbooks/kv-cache-dtype-rollout.md","document_kind":"curated","workspace":"task/jamal-kv-cache-dtype-34752","team":""}}},"conflict_id":null,"change_id":"qdrant:f757229d17e91674a4ce0ef6"},{"table":"knowledge","key":{"id":"workspace_101071d82d702ddff3249333:00001"},"change":"added","before":null,"after":{"id":"workspace_101071d82d702ddff3249333:00001","vector":{"bm25":{"indices":[3198288,11875599,19522071,24962933,30749239,35721292,63469310,86022670,107966814,117848935,118939517,152217691,153699907,158490405,180848622,182765111,197018161,212267115,240141321,243905464,248564600,264653773,264659253,264741300,299114802,310274930,310830179,314885586,340679327,349560678,376415374,377896724,380207636,390626577,442064690,448220673,454222729,465629622,482263480,497334170,513900473,516830072,520427161,572399988,575491131,579782570,588093802,603392360,657119655,660890323,661276429,668707053,670727360,672811249,743805293,753371676,761125475,763516357,766710245,772165269,775275475,800816682,838568274,845019103,859151139,862670896,869433802,894358650,895170090,926244272,938486536,938810730,947370367,964907347,989134019,1009084850,1024530264,1024951234,1054955099,1055677912,1069826093,1082867806,1086755457,1086921121,1100855371,1108634416,1114505193,1132748958,1144867018,1151308235,1164717190,1172383616,1176022733,1177157900,1187159329,1224124695,1254444102,1283123381,1295245089,1329498937,1337579030,1357846105,1394226660,1411331690,1432619228,1449660732,1454175664,1473575972,1477831504,1480511547,1511580802,1515372845,1518651811,1519078073,1535067589,1536651520,1538510857,1539641452,1566116842,1590428327,1609150872,1629248235,1632527124,1645540475,1646401716,1653414040,1662505136,1678348498,1709660394,1733190280,1734550606,1744026415,1751311563,1754526443,1763574823,1796076708,1810453357,